   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "Designed with world travelers in mind. The STRATONAUT GMT displays the time in 5 different timezones in 24 hour GMT/UTC via its mirrored GMT hand and the bi-directional bezel. It is water resistant up to 200m / 660ft. A slim, 12.5 mm thick watch featuring an anti-magnetic Faraday cage, housing an ETA 2893-2 movement, ensuring accurate timekeeping at all times . Through thoughtful design and engineering, the watch has a low center of gravity towards the wrist, making it very comfortable to wear throughout the day . The case diameter is 41mm with a beautifully designed dial face and hands with C3 Swiss Super-Luminova​​® Lume , offering superb readability . The stainless steel bracelet has a custom 'Easy Glide' clasp, meaning any micro adjustments can be performed by hand. No special tools are required .",
